!Portable version/Any-WALLEX-Portable/data/profiles/exchange_knowledge.json
!Portable version/Any-WALLEX-Portable/data/profiles/batch_setup_results.json
!Portable version/Any-WALLEX-Portable/data/profiles/_reference/
